3.6 a game) is already in the numbers.","goals":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 2.6 goals","text":"The numbers say 2.6 goals, already lifted for Bologna's scoring run (+5%) and cut for Gueye. Two things the numbers can't see pull opposite ways: Bologna lose Miranda's crossing from the left and Davis is not fully cleared, but Udinese's back three come in tired from international trips with thin cover behind them; I drop my small lean and stay at about 2.6."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9.5 corners","text":"The numbers say 9.5 corners. Bologna's wide play goes on through Zortea and Alhassane, and Udinese under Zanetti defend with a back three in a 3-5-2 or 3-4-2-1, close to what the numbers assume, so I stay at about 9.5."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 3.8 cards","text":"The numbers say 3.8 cards and already count Marinelli's near-average record. Udinese have been calm lately (7 cards in six) while Zanetti asks for more bite in duels, which could add a foul or two, but nothing clear points either way, so I stay at about 3.8."},"shots":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-2,"call":"Around 25.6 shots","text":"The numbers say 26.1 shots, already lifted for both sides' recent shooting. Miranda's absence costs Bologna an attacking outlet and a Davis short of full fitness would give Udinese little up front, neither of which the numbers know; a small nudge down to about 25.6."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 8.7 on target","text":"The numbers say 8.7 shots on target, already raised for Bologna's sharp recent shooting (+16%). Orsolini and Odgaard are expected to lead the line as usual and Davis is listed to start for Udinese, so I stay at about 8.7."},"sources":["https://www.pazzidifanta.com/news/bologna-udinese-probabili-formazioni-12a-giornata-serie-a-2026-2027-460766","https://www.fantamaster.it/probabili-formazioni-bologna-udinese-12-giornata-seriea-2026-2027/","https://www.tuttomerca